<fo:block text-align="justify" font-size="16pt" font-weight="bold" space-before="20pt" text-indent="0em" keep-with-next="always"><fo:inline font-style="normal" id="W0043-08-0080-pb-043d"/><fo:inline role="W0043-08-0080-pb-043d" font-style="normal" font-weight="bold" font-size="12pt">[40]</fo:inline><fo:inline> </fo:inline>Dvbivm LII.</fo:block>
<fo:block text-align="center" font-size="20pt" font-weight="normal" space-before="5mm"><fo:inline padding-left="0.2cm" padding-right="0.2cm" font-size="20pt" font-weight="normal"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline font-style="italic">An teneatur qui<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>que fidelis Fidem manifestare, quoties à potestate publica (quæcumque illa <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>it,) de fide rogatur etiam<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>i<fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>ecreto rogetur, vel generalis examinatio fiat?</fo:inline></fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0043-08-0080-pa-068b" text-align="justify" font-size="12pt" text-indent="0em"><fo:inline baseline-shift="super" font-size="9pt" font-weight="bold" id="#W0043-08-0080-nm-0510"><fo:basic-link color="#0a0c75" internal-destination="W0043-08-0080-nm-0510">296</fo:basic-link></fo:inline><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline font-family="serif" font-size="18pt" space-before="0.1mm" space-after="0.1mm">R</fo:inline>Ogari quis pote<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>t à Rege, ac Superiore proprio, vel extraneo. Rogari pote<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>t publice, vel <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>ecreto. Rogari<fo:inline> </fo:inline>pote<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>t generaliter, vel in particulari. Rogari ab homine priuato pote<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>t. Quæ<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>ierim in primis, an quis <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>it obligatus fidem manife<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>tare, quoties à pote<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>tate publica, (quęcũque illa <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>it,) de fide, aut genenliter inter plures, at in particulari ip<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>e <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>olus de Fide interrogetur?</fo:block>
