<fo:block id="W0043-08-0113-d4-0800"><fo:block text-align="justify" font-size="16pt" font-weight="bold" space-before="20pt" text-indent="0em" keep-with-next="always"><fo:inline font-style="normal" id="W0043-08-0113-pb-0460"/><fo:inline role="W0043-08-0113-pb-0460" font-style="normal" font-weight="bold" font-size="12pt">[73]</fo:inline><fo:inline> </fo:inline>Dvbivm CXVI.</fo:block>
